# API Client Layer

- Pure data access only — no UI/React
- Return typed results (no `any`); throw errors with safe, useful messages
- Transform at the boundary with mappers (`api` → domain); keep raw DB/API shapes out of components

```typescript
export async function fetchStudents(): Promise<Student[]> {
  const response = await fetch('/api/students')
  if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`Failed to fetch students: ${response.statusText}`)
  return response.json()
}
```
